      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "The [`JSManagedValue`](jsmanagedvalue.md) object is reachable through the Objective-C or Swift object graph, as you report to the JavaScriptCore virtual machine using the [`addManagedReference(_:withOwner:)`](jsvirtualmachine/addmanagedreference(_:withowner:).md) method.",
      "normalizedSource": "The [`JSManagedValue`](jsmanagedvalue.md) object is reachable through the Objective-C or Swift object graph, as you report to the JavaScriptCore virtual machine using the [`addManagedReference(_:withOwner:)`](jsvirtualmachine/addmanagedreference(_:withowner:).md) method.",
